name: Budgeted text regeneration preserves human context and compares an inactive copy
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_regeneration.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks secret-scan
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | study
keys: Down Down Down Enter Up Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | selected-parent
keys: e Down Down Down Down g
require-live-snap: 20 REGENERATE CONTEXT TEXT | selected-text-job
expect: One selected-text job
expect: Alpha receiver · Purpose
ask: Does selecting regeneration keep a single explanatory field, explicit spending and an inactive-copy boundary, with no model request before approval?
keys: G
require-live-snap: 20 REGENERATION GUIDANCE | guidance-editor
paste-file: @ART/guidance.txt
require-live-snap: 15 Keep human context α | multiline-guidance
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 15 REGENERATE CONTEXT TEXT | guidance-back
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 15 Your guidance draft is kept | guidance-preserved
ask: Is unsaved multiline guidance preserved and clearly excluded until saved, with preparation blocked instead of silently dropping it?
keys: G C-s M
require-live-snap: 20 MODEL | model-picker
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 REGENERATE CONTEXT TEXT | restored-model-origin
keys: t
type: 5
keys: Enter r
type: 2
keys: Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | frozen-one-job
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_regeneration.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
resize: 160x48
live-snap: plan-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: plan-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: plan-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: plan-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: plan-40x12
expect: Tab options
expect: PgUp/Dn
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: small-plan-last
expect: Allowance not approved
ask: Can the operator read the full bounded plan at every size while keeping model, allowance, guidance, option and paging controls visible?
resize: 120x36
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 EXACT GENERATION OPTIONS | exact-options
expect: Keep human context α
keys: Tab Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | approval
keys: End
require-live-snap: 15 y approve | approval-last
expect: 1 fixed jobs
expect: Total provider calls: 5
ask: Does approval bind one job and one attempt to the exact parent, selected model and five shared calls, with two protected review calls and uncertain dollars?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 Open approved context job | approved
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 L starts the approved jobs | before-launch
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | launched
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_regeneration.py @TMP_TARGET @ART finished
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 1 job(s) · 1 completed | completed
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 REGENERATION RESULT | saved-result
expect: Inspect generated context
ask: Does the real executor expose its inactive result for inspection while retaining spending, original context, human text and protected review allocation?
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | exact-candidate
keys: d
require-live-snap: 25 Labeled regeneration | compare
expect: Before:
expect: After:
expect: Records the fixture input
ask: Does comparison read the exact parent and candidate, show the proposed text change and keep study selection separate from saving?
resize: 40x12
live-snap: compare-40x12
expect: Alpha receiver · Purpose
expect: Before:
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: compare-small-last
expect: PgUp/Dn
resize: 120x36
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Context selected for this study | selected-candidate
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | separate-study-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_regeneration.py @TMP_TARGET @ART scan-draft
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 1 job(s) · 1 completed | recovered-campaign
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 REGENERATION RESULT | recovered-result
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | recovered-candidate
keys: d
require-live-snap: 25 Labeled regeneration | recovered-comparison
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_regeneration.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: After a real no-color restart, does the exact result and parent comparison recover with one intercepted request total, no repeat work and unchanged active context?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
